      "writtenOn": "2022-03-31T20:34:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nissa/Nereid are using an alternate power sequencing implementation: CONFIG_AP_PWRSEQ.  https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/8be1e6b6/zephyr/projects/nissa/prj.conf#53\n\nThis alternate power sequencing implementation is here:\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/chromeos_public/src/platform/ec/zephyr/subsys/ap_pwrseq/\n\nThis new implementation uses the device tree to specify the power sequence signals instead of relying on hard-coded GPIO names.\n\nI opened b/227651161 to track the S4 residency support with the new AP power sequencing subsystem.",
      "parentUuid": "6a5bf0de_84248103",
      "revId": "9f98c461a4fa6f326ebb2495bd9c4ec4c8f633f0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
